OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle arrested
OL,4,Aover allegations he possessed child sex
OL,5,Aabuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been arrested in
OL,9,FFlorida
OL,11,FSources familiar with the matter tell
OL,12,FCBS News, the BBC's US media partner,
OL,13,FMarkle was arrested over allegations he
OL,14,Fpossessed child sex abuse material
OL,16,FEarlier this month it was reported that
OL,17,Fhundreds of images of child sexual
OL,18,Fabuse allegedly belonging to Markle,
OL,19,F82, had been found at a property in the
OL,20,FPhilippines
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
