OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle arrested
OL,4,Aover allegations he possessed child sex
OL,5,Aabuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe previously denied the allegations,
OL,8,Fdescribing them as "sick lies"
OL,10,FThe duchess has been estranged from her
OL,11,Ffather for years. In a statement last
OL,12,Fweek, the wife of Prince Harry said: "I
OL,13,Fam deeply distressed... my thoughts are
OL,14,Fwith any children who may have been
OL,15,Fharmed"
OL,17,FShe added that she hoped it could be
OL,18,Funderstood why she had largely cut off
OL,19,Fcontact from her father
